{"id":"665133","name":"香干炒肉片","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/665133/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香干","amount":"250g"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"2瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香干切约五毫米厚的片备用。","img":"images/665133/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头剁碎。","img":"images/665133/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"瘦肉用少许生粉、生抽，腌制20分钟。","img":"images/665133/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中倒入适量油，爆香蒜头。","img":"images/665133/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下肉片翻炒一下。","img":"images/665133/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再倒入香干。","img":"images/665133/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋入少许生抽。","img":"images/665133/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"少许鸡粉。","img":"images/665133/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"半匙盐。","img":"images/665133/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒入少许辣椒粉。","img":"images/665133/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀，加半碗清水，中小火焖煮5分钟即可。","img":"images/665133/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}